    <item>
      <title>Celebrating America's 250th Grant Spotlight: People's Light &amp;amp; Theatre Company</title>
      <link>https://www.arts.gov/stories/blog/2026/celebrating-americas-250th-grant-spotlight-peoples-light-theatre-company</link>
      <description>"The Woman Question," a new play premiering at People's Light this spring in celebration of America's 250th, focuses on the lives of students and faculty at the Women’s Medical College of Pennsylvania during the late 19th century.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.arts.gov/stories/blog/2026/celebrating-americas-250th-grant-spotlight-peoples-light-theatre-company</guid>
